    {
      "id": "sec_s1l3_r2",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Lafz se lafz mil kar jumla banta hai. Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi mukhtalif jumle hain. Jis tarah ab aap alfaaz samajhne lage hain, usi tarah mein Sha' Allah bohot jald Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi samajhne lagenge.",
        "content": "Lafz se lafz mil kar jumla banta hai. Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi mukhtalif jumle hain. Jis tarah ab aap alfaaz samajhne lage hain, usi tarah mein Sha' Allah bohot jald Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi samajhne lagenge.",
        "hinglish_text": "Lafz se lafz mil kar jumla banta hai. Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi mukhtalif jumle hain. Jis tarah ab aap alfaaz samajhne lage hain, usi tarah mein Sha' Allah bohot jald Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi samajhne lagenge."
      }
